    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hey {race}!\n\nRin'ji lost axe and was captured! Please, help Rin'ji escape. Me know that {race} like you don't like Rin'ji's kind, but Rin'ji begs! Must get out of here!\n\nGot something for nice {race} if $Ghe helps Rin'ji out of here:she helps Rin'ji out of here;...\n\nRin'ji is hiding something secret at the Overlook Cliffs.",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "Escort Rin'ji to safety",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Escort Rin'ji to safety",
          "type": "event"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Escort Rin'ji out of the Quel'Danil Lodge, then find his hidden secret at the Overlook Cliffs to the east.",
